This package vendors:

1. github.com/golang/protobuf v1.5.x

This is necessary because Caddy requires golang-github-golang-protobuf-1-5-dev, while golang-github-prometheus-client-golang-dev must build with golang-github-golang-protobuf-1-3-dev, which is incompatible to the former; should be revisited once the reverse dependencies of golang-github-prometheus-client-golang-dev have migrated away from genproto APIv1 and no longer require golang-github-golang-protobuf-1-3-dev or golang-gogoprotobuf-dev

2. Multiple libraries from google.golang.org/genproto libraries that are stuck in experimental because of the same problem
